WEBVTT

00:01.345 --> 00:04.034
<i>[energetic music]</i>
<i>[充满活力的音乐]</i>

00:04.103 --> 00:11.069
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:11.138 --> 00:15.896
[laughing evilly]
[邪恶地笑]

00:15.965 --> 00:19.000
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

00:19.069 --> 00:22.034
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:22.103 --> 00:24.276
Very sloppy, Eugene.
非常马虎，尤金。

00:24.345 --> 00:26.241
<i>Leaving an unprotected
vent that leads</i>
<i>离开不受保护的地方
导致的通风口</i>

00:26.310 --> 00:28.862
<i>right into your office.</i>
<i>直接进入您的办公室。</i>

00:28.931 --> 00:32.345
[laughing evilly]
[邪恶地笑]

00:34.138 --> 00:36.069
Perfect.
完美的。

00:36.138 --> 00:38.896
The secret formula
is as good as mine.
秘密公式
和我的一样好。

00:38.965 --> 00:41.862
Ah!
啊!

00:41.931 --> 00:43.448
I made it.
我做到了。

00:43.517 --> 00:45.310
Yes!
是的！

00:47.069 --> 00:49.931
[humming happily]
[高兴地哼哼]

00:50.000 --> 00:53.000
♪ F is for friends
who do stuff together ♪
♪ F 代表朋友
谁一起做事♪

00:53.069 --> 00:55.413
♪ U is for you and me ♪
♪ U 适合你和我 ♪

00:55.482 --> 00:59.379
[gargling]
[漱口]

00:59.448 --> 01:01.931
♪ N is for anywhere
and anytime at all ♪
♪ N 代表任何地方
任何时候 ♪

01:02.000 --> 01:03.034
Huh?
啊？

01:03.103 --> 01:04.758
[screams]
[尖叫声]

01:04.827 --> 01:08.345
[groaning in pain]
[痛苦呻吟]

01:08.413 --> 01:11.276
♪ Down here
in the deep blue sea ♪
♪ 在这里
在深蓝色的大海里♪

01:11.345 --> 01:13.758
[panting frantically]
[疯狂地喘气]

01:15.620 --> 01:17.551
Aah!
啊啊！

01:17.620 --> 01:22.827
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

01:22.896 --> 01:26.138
Bubble Bass!
Are you brushing your teeth?
泡泡贝斯！
你在刷牙吗？

01:26.207 --> 01:27.862
Yes, Mother.
是的，妈妈。

01:27.931 --> 01:29.517
Ugh!
啊!

01:29.586 --> 01:30.586
[exhales deeply]
[深呼气]

01:30.655 --> 01:32.172
Oof!
钱币！

01:32.241 --> 01:34.345
Oh, no.
哦，不。

01:34.413 --> 01:38.517
[muffled shouting]
[低声喊叫]

01:43.827 --> 01:46.345
Aah!
啊啊！

01:48.586 --> 01:49.862
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:49.931 --> 01:52.172
Hmm? Eh, yuck.
唔？呃，恶心。

01:52.241 --> 01:54.241
This place is filthier
than the bathroom
这个地方比较脏
比浴室

01:54.310 --> 01:56.724
in my old fraternity house.
在我的老兄弟会房子里。

01:56.793 --> 01:57.896
Time to get out of here.
是时候离开这里了。

01:57.965 --> 01:59.862
[loud grunting]
[大声咕哝]

01:59.931 --> 02:01.551
[shuddering]
[颤抖]

02:01.620 --> 02:03.172
Terrified,
害怕，

02:03.241 --> 02:06.069
mind blank,
possibly wetting pants.
脑子一片空白，
可能会弄湿裤子。

02:06.138 --> 02:08.207
Wait. I don't wear pants.
等待。我不穿裤子。

02:08.276 --> 02:10.689
Ooh, lucky me.
哦，我很幸运。

02:10.758 --> 02:13.551
[growling]
[咆哮]

02:13.620 --> 02:17.000
[slime bubbling]
[粘液冒泡]

02:17.069 --> 02:19.517
Aah!
啊啊！

02:19.586 --> 02:22.620
That's right.
You better run.
这是正确的。
你最好跑。

02:22.689 --> 02:24.069
Huh?
啊？

02:24.138 --> 02:27.965
<i>[ominous music]</i>
<i>[不祥的音乐]</i>

02:28.034 --> 02:29.620
Terror doubled.
恐怖倍增。

02:29.689 --> 02:32.551
Please!
I'll do whatever you say!
请！
我会照你说的做！

02:32.620 --> 02:35.345
Just don't hurt me!
[sobs]
只是别伤害我！
[抽泣]

02:35.413 --> 02:39.207
We would never hurt the Master.
我们绝不会伤害师父。

02:39.276 --> 02:42.345
[all speaking gibberish]
【全都是胡言乱语】

02:42.413 --> 02:44.207
Wait, what, now?
等等，现在什么？

02:44.276 --> 02:46.379
We are praising you,
我们赞美你，

02:46.448 --> 02:48.655
the Master Creator.
造物主。

02:48.724 --> 02:49.793
Me?
我？

02:49.862 --> 02:51.241
Yes.
是的。

02:51.310 --> 02:53.138
We are C.H.U.M.
我们是 C.H.U.M.

02:53.207 --> 02:57.965
Collective Hive Under Master.
主人领导下的集体蜂巢。

02:58.034 --> 03:00.793
You are Master.
你是师父。

03:00.862 --> 03:03.862
You create us
when you flush chum
你创造了我们
当你冲洗密友时

03:03.931 --> 03:05.793
into sewer
进入下水道

03:05.862 --> 03:07.100
from your upside domain.
来自您的上域。

03:08.069 --> 03:09.896
You mean the Chum Bucket?
你是说密友桶吗？

03:09.965 --> 03:11.172
Yes.
是的。

03:11.241 --> 03:14.724
Chum mixes
with gasses in sewer...
密友混合
下水道里有气体...

03:14.793 --> 03:16.793
[belches loudly]
[大声打嗝]

03:16.862 --> 03:19.069
To form we.
来组成我们。

03:19.138 --> 03:20.310
Goo-goo.
咕咕。

03:20.379 --> 03:22.965
Hmm, makes sense,
嗯，有道理，

03:23.034 --> 03:24.413
huh...
呵呵...

03:24.482 --> 03:26.965
in a stupid sort of way.
以一种愚蠢的方式。

03:27.034 --> 03:29.448
Eh!
呃！

03:29.517 --> 03:31.413
Whoa, what's happening?
哇，发生什么事了？

03:31.482 --> 03:34.103
Master must come to village
师父必须到村里来

03:34.172 --> 03:36.758
so we may worship him.
这样我们就可以敬拜他。

03:36.827 --> 03:39.862
Well, I do love to be worshiped.
嗯，我确实喜欢被崇拜。

03:41.413 --> 03:44.138
Hold on.
How did you recognize me?
坚持，稍等。
你是怎么认出我的？

03:44.207 --> 03:46.896
From sacred scrapbook.
来自神圣的剪贴簿。

03:50.034 --> 03:52.379
Ah!
啊!

03:55.965 --> 03:58.896
We save all articles
about Master
我们保存所有文章
关于师父

03:58.965 --> 04:00.655
that float down here.
漂浮在这里。

04:00.724 --> 04:03.586
Here review of Chum Bucket.
这里回顾一下 Chum Bucket。

04:03.655 --> 04:06.276
You get one negative toilet.
你会得到一个负厕所。

04:06.345 --> 04:10.310
That must be highest
rating possible.
这个应该是最高的
评级可能。

04:10.379 --> 04:11.965
[chuckles]
Yep.
[笑声]
是的。

04:12.034 --> 04:13.482
That's the highest, all right.
这是最高的了，好吧。

04:13.551 --> 04:15.827
[chuckles]
Let's just close that.
[笑声]
让我们结束吧。

04:15.896 --> 04:18.793
<i>[quirky music]</i>
<i>[古怪的音乐]</i>

04:18.862 --> 04:22.241
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

04:22.310 --> 04:24.207
[grunts]
[咕哝]

04:24.276 --> 04:29.827
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

04:29.896 --> 04:32.827
Ah!
[grunts]
啊!
[咕哝]

04:32.896 --> 04:34.517
[groaning]
[呻吟]

04:34.586 --> 04:37.586
The Master is pleased
with our village?
师父很高兴
和我们村？

04:38.620 --> 04:41.931
Uh, sure.
Why not?
呃，当然。
为什么不呢？

04:41.100 --> 04:44.345
Oh, thank you, Master.
噢，谢谢师父。

04:44.413 --> 04:45.100
Thank you.
谢谢。

04:46.069 --> 04:47.448
That's enough of that.
这就足够了。

04:47.517 --> 04:49.482
Do you have a napkin
or something
你有餐巾吗
或者什么

04:49.551 --> 04:51.207
I can use to wipe my hands off?
我可以用来擦手吗？

04:51.276 --> 04:53.689
A napkin for Master!
给师父的餐巾纸！

04:53.758 --> 04:55.620
Yuck.
恶心。

04:55.689 --> 04:57.448
Thanks, but try to be
谢谢，但要努力成为

04:57.517 --> 04:59.862
a little faster next time.
下次快一点。

04:59.931 --> 05:04.034
So you C.H.U.M.
would really do anything
所以你C.H.U.M.
真的会做任何事情

05:04.103 --> 05:05.413
for me?
为我？

05:05.482 --> 05:07.172
Yes, yes.
是的，是的。

05:07.241 --> 05:09.310
Whatever the Master wishes.
师父所愿如是。

05:09.379 --> 05:10.586
Wah!
哇！

05:10.655 --> 05:13.551
Hmm, this gives me an idea.
嗯，这给了我一个想法。

05:13.620 --> 05:14.100
I don't need to steal
我不需要偷

05:15.069 --> 05:18.138
the secret Krabby Patty
formula by stealth.
秘密的克拉比帕蒂
隐秘公式。

05:18.207 --> 05:20.586
With you C.H.U.M. by my side,
和你一起 C.H.U.M.在我身边，

05:20.655 --> 05:23.448
I can take it by force!
我可以强行拿下！

05:23.517 --> 05:25.103
Yes, yes.
是的，是的。

05:25.172 --> 05:27.551
Whatever the Master wishes.
师父所愿如是。

05:27.620 --> 05:30.345
Ew. All right, then.
呃。好吧，那么。

05:30.413 --> 05:33.276
Line up for assault training.
列队进行突击训练。

05:33.345 --> 05:35.896
[laughing evilly]
[邪恶地笑]

05:35.965 --> 05:38.138
[bugle playing]
[号角演奏]

05:38.207 --> 05:42.551
In order to successfully
infiltrate the Krusty Krab,
为了成功
渗透到蟹堡王，

05:42.620 --> 05:45.965
you'll need to batter
some doors down.
你需要击打
有些门下来了。

05:46.034 --> 05:47.100
Now get to battering!
现在开始殴打吧！

05:48.069 --> 05:52.689
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

05:52.758 --> 05:55.207
You call that battering?
你管这叫殴打？

05:55.276 --> 05:57.103
Batter harder.
更用力地击球。

05:57.172 --> 05:59.034
Ah!
啊!

05:59.103 --> 06:01.100
Wait, no, stop!
等等，不，停下来！

06:04.689 --> 06:07.241
How was that, Master?
师父，怎么样？

06:07.310 --> 06:10.345
[groans]
[呻吟]

06:10.413 --> 06:13.310
In order for my plan to succeed,
为了让我的计划能够成功，

06:13.379 --> 06:16.241
you will need
to be expert marksmen.
你会需要
成为专家射手。

06:16.310 --> 06:19.034
Line up and form up.
排队并列队。

06:19.103 --> 06:21.689
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

06:21.758 --> 06:24.931
[both chattering wildly]
[两人都在疯狂地喋喋不休]

06:24.100 --> 06:28.620
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

06:28.689 --> 06:30.207
Hold on, hold on.
坚持住，坚持住。

06:30.276 --> 06:32.517
Let me just put up
these targets before you fire.
让我放一下
在你开火之前这些目标。

06:32.586 --> 06:34.241
Master say fire!
师父说火！

06:34.310 --> 06:35.793
- [screams]
- [shouts]
- [尖叫]
- [喊叫]

06:35.862 --> 06:36.862
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

06:36.931 --> 06:41.241
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

06:41.310 --> 06:43.655
How was our aim, Master?
师父，我们的目标是怎样的？

06:43.724 --> 06:47.586
Eh, impeccable.
嗯，无可挑剔。

06:47.655 --> 06:49.965
When we finally enter
the Krusty Krab,
当我们最终进入
蟹堡王，

06:50.034 --> 06:52.517
you will face an enemy more evil
你将面对一个更邪恶的敌人

06:52.586 --> 06:55.413
than any of you can imagine.
超乎你们的想象。

06:55.482 --> 06:57.827
[all gasp, screaming]
[全都喘气，尖叫]

06:57.896 --> 07:00.758
To get past Krabs
and his vile cronies
为了绕过蟹蟹
和他的卑鄙亲信

07:00.827 --> 07:03.069
and make it
to the secret formula,
并做到
到秘密公式，

07:03.138 --> 07:07.655
you will need to be experts
in the deadly art of karate.
你需要成为专家
在致命的空手道艺术中。

07:07.724 --> 07:10.551
Hoo! Ha! Wah!
呼！哈!哇！

07:10.620 --> 07:13.689
[grunting violently]
[剧烈地咕哝]

07:16.724 --> 07:19.758
Now show Master what you got.
现在让师父看看你得到了什么。

07:25.931 --> 07:28.310
A-plus.
[sighs]
A+。
[叹气]

07:28.379 --> 07:31.241
You're ready.
[sighs]
你准备好了。
[叹气]

07:31.310 --> 07:33.241
Ay!
哎呀！

07:33.310 --> 07:35.551
[humming happily]
[高兴地哼哼]

07:35.620 --> 07:38.862
- Hello, Eugene.
- Plankton?
- 你好，尤金。
- 浮游生物？

07:38.931 --> 07:40.100
Ah, get out of here
before I flush you.
啊，离开这里
在我冲洗你之前。

07:41.069 --> 07:43.100
The only thing getting
flushed around here
唯一得到的就是
在这里泛红

07:44.069 --> 07:46.896
are your hopes
of the Krabby Patty formula
是你的希望
蟹黄饼配方

07:46.965 --> 07:49.758
not being stolen by me!
没有被我偷走！

07:49.827 --> 07:52.172
Huh, you and what army?
呃，你和什么军队？

07:52.241 --> 07:54.862
Me and my C.H.U.M. army.
我和我的 C.H.U.M.军队。

07:54.931 --> 07:57.103
[gasps]
[喘气]

07:57.172 --> 07:58.482
[laughing evilly]
[邪恶地笑]

07:58.551 --> 08:00.793
Plankton, what insanity is this?
浮游生物，这是什么疯子？

08:00.862 --> 08:03.172
The insanity of genius!
天才的疯狂！

08:03.241 --> 08:05.172
What's that chum doing?
那个朋友在做什么？

08:05.241 --> 08:08.138
Anything I want it to.
我想要什么都可以。

08:10.482 --> 08:12.724
[laughing evilly]
[邪恶地笑]

08:12.793 --> 08:15.689
<i>[suspenseful music]</i>
<i>[悬疑音乐]</i>

08:15.758 --> 08:17.172
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

08:17.241 --> 08:18.620
Oh, Krabs.
哦，蟹蟹。

08:18.689 --> 08:20.758
You look a little hungry.
你看起来有点饿了。

08:20.827 --> 08:23.896
Give him a taste, boys.
孩子们，让他尝尝吧。

08:23.965 --> 08:25.310
Ha, ha, ha!
哈哈哈！

08:25.379 --> 08:28.517
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:28.586 --> 08:31.103
[shouting]
[喊叫]

08:31.172 --> 08:34.724
- [humming]
- SpongeBob! SpongeBob!
- [嗡嗡声]
- 海绵宝宝！海绵宝宝！

08:34.793 --> 08:37.138
[vocalizing]
[发声]

08:37.207 --> 08:42.896
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

08:42.965 --> 08:45.345
You'll never get me formula.
你永远不会给我配方。

08:45.413 --> 08:47.276
Today your formula.
今天你的公式。

08:47.345 --> 08:50.689
Tomorrow the world.
明天的世界。

08:50.758 --> 08:53.655
You can't hide forever, Krabs.
你不能永远隐藏，蟹蟹。

08:53.724 --> 08:56.138
Come meet your stinky fate.
来迎接你的臭命运吧。

08:56.207 --> 08:59.138
[laughing evilly]
[邪恶地笑]

08:59.207 --> 09:01.620
Sorry, Krabs.
对不起，蟹蟹。

09:01.689 --> 09:04.310
Your aging acrobatics
are no match
你的衰老杂技
不匹配

09:04.379 --> 09:06.517
for my C.H.U.M. monster.
为了我的 C.H.U.M.怪物。

09:06.586 --> 09:07.724
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

09:07.793 --> 09:09.276
So long, suckers.
再见，傻瓜们。

09:09.345 --> 09:10.931
Ah!
啊!

09:10.100 --> 09:13.896
Oh, shrimp!
噢，虾！

09:13.965 --> 09:15.379
Attack!
攻击！

09:15.448 --> 09:17.482
My putrescent platoon!
我腐烂的排！

09:17.551 --> 09:19.103
Eat splinters, ugly!
吃碎片，丑！

09:19.172 --> 09:20.896
Oh!
哦！

09:20.965 --> 09:22.138
Whoa!
哇！

09:22.207 --> 09:27.069
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

09:27.138 --> 09:28.896
[upbeat music playing
on headphones]
[欢快的音乐响起
在耳机上]

09:28.965 --> 09:29.965
Oh!
哦！

09:31.793 --> 09:34.379
This is your
last chance, Eugene.
这是你的
最后一次机会，尤金。

09:34.448 --> 09:37.241
Give up the formula or else!
放弃公式，否则！

09:37.310 --> 09:39.241
Or else what?
不然又怎样？

09:39.310 --> 09:41.207
Gah!
- Whoa!
嘎！
- 哇！

09:41.276 --> 09:44.482
Or else this!
不然这个！

09:44.551 --> 09:46.827
All right, all right,
I'll give you what you want.
好吧，好吧，
我会给你你想要的。

09:46.896 --> 09:49.655
Just please don't hurt me.
只是请不要伤害我。

09:49.724 --> 09:52.448
SpongeBob, help!
海绵宝宝，救命啊！

09:52.517 --> 09:56.724
[monster growling]
- SpongeBob!
[怪物咆哮]
- 海绵宝宝！

09:56.793 --> 09:58.931
Stop him!
阻止他！

10:01.413 --> 10:03.689
Ooh, a penny!
哦，一分钱！

10:03.758 --> 10:06.069
Not again.
不会再有。

10:06.138 --> 10:08.034
Ah!
啊!

10:09.551 --> 10:10.793
Oh!
哦！

10:10.862 --> 10:12.100
I'm so sorry, Mr. Krabs.
我很抱歉，蟹老板。

10:13.069 --> 10:15.345
My little hero!
我的小英雄！

10:15.413 --> 10:16.517
Mwah!
哇！

10:16.586 --> 10:18.689
Ooh.
[giggles]
哦。
[咯咯笑]

10:21.276 --> 10:23.689
Well, thanks for trying, anyway.
好吧，无论如何，谢谢你的尝试。

10:23.758 --> 10:25.724
So, uh,
所以，呃，

10:25.793 --> 10:27.689
you guys want to hang out,
you know,
你们想出去玩，
你知道，

10:27.758 --> 10:29.965
maybe worship me a little more.
也许更崇拜我一点。

10:30.034 --> 10:34.413
No, we think C.H.U.M.
happier in the sewer.
不，我们认为 C.H.U.M.
下水道里更快乐。

10:34.482 --> 10:36.310
Too crazy up here.
这里太疯狂了。

10:36.379 --> 10:39.310
But you'll keep
worshipping me, right?
但你会保留
崇拜我吧？

10:39.379 --> 10:41.034
We check our schedule.
我们检查我们的日程安排。

10:41.103 --> 10:42.896
Get back to you.
回到你身边。

10:42.965 --> 10:46.965
[toilet flushes]
- Aw.
[厕所冲水]
- 噢。

[厕所冲水]
- 噢。